    "title": "Special Marine Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here For the following areas... Hawk Channel and Straits of Florida from west end of Seven Mile Bridge to Halfmoon Shoal out 20 nm... Gulf of America from west end of Seven Mile Bridge to Halfmoon Shoal out to 5 fathoms... At 1227 AM EDT, a strong thunderstorm was located over Vaca Cut Daybeacon 13, moving west at 15 knots. HAZARD...Wind gusts 34 knots or greater. SOURCE...National Weather Service Meteorologist. IMPACT...Expect wind gusts in excess of 34 knots, suddenly higher waves, frequent lightning, and heavy downpours. Locations in the warning include... Looe Key Light, American Shoal Light, and Ninefoot Shoal.",
